&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive Partner-Led Platform Consumption: &lt;/strong&gt;Co-architect complex partner solutions that accelerate customer adoption, deployment velocity, and platform usage across Customer Lake environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expand Lakewatch Observability: &lt;/strong&gt;Guide partner engineering teams on deploying Lakewatch to deliver automated data quality monitoring and health telemetry across customer implementations&lt;/li&gt;
